        &lt;SUBSERVICE qualifier="DID_F3_ECU_ID" id="0x0f1e894c" active="true" actQual="ReadDid"&gt;
          &lt;CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
            &lt;CFGVARIANTREF ref="0x15406144"/&gt;
          &lt;/CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
          &lt;DESC&gt;The ECU_ID is a 16 byte, secure static memory, unsigned string which stores a controller specific unique number which is a concatenation of a 4 byte sequence number, a 4 byte base model part number, a 5 byte FNA (Functional Name Address) code and 3 byte UPC (Uniform Parts Code).  This value is used to uniquely identify each ECU.  

Refer to Security ECU_ID Controller Requirements for more detail.&lt;/DESC&gt;
