          &lt;DESC&gt;This DID contains the System Name or Engine Type which identifies the electronic system name (e.g. Automatic Transmission with 2.0 L engine: GS820 X20XEV) or engine type (X30XE) installed.  The data shall always be of type ASCII.  The length is variable (depends on length of string) but shall not exceed 20 characters.&lt;/DESC&gt;
