        &lt;SUBSERVICE qualifier="DID_F5_DVT_Access_KeyTable_Index_Change_KTIC" id="0x15608034" active="true" actQual="WriteDid"&gt;
          &lt;CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
            &lt;CFGVARIANTREF ref="0x155bd254"/&gt;
          &lt;/CFGVARIANTREFS&gt;
          &lt;DESC&gt;ECUs will be shipped from suppliers with a SecurityAccess ($27) sub-function ($03) written into controller Secure Static NVM.  This DID provides GM Manufacturing the ability to overwrite byte 5 of the SecurityAccess ($27) sub-function ($03) Challenge only when the 4 MSB of the ($04) Response are $FF and the MEC &amp;gt; $00.  Although the initial default value Challenge for KTI_03 is 0x01, the supplier can be directed to increment this value at the discretion of GM.
The controller shall respond to a DID 0xF5, $3B write request with NRC ($22) Conditions Not Correct when the MEC = $00. &lt;/DESC&gt;
